table(['Test ID','Purpose and input','Expected and actual','Status'],[[c['id'],c['purpose']+'\n'+c['input'],c['expected']+'\nActual: '+c['actual'],c['status']] for c in cases])
h('5.3 Test Evidence',2);p('evidence/test-output.txt records 51 passing tests. evidence/test-cases.json and .md map each test to a unique ID, precondition, input, expected and actual result. The public snapshot is evidence/sepolia-v3-final-snapshot.json. The fresh three-contract deployment was followed by tournament #1: 0.001 ETH prize, 1 LRT bonus, three players each paying 0.001 ETH, shares 50/30/20. Referee ranking 4/5/6 was objected to by account 6, and resolver ranking 5/4/6 settled the event. Accounts 5/4/6 withdrew 0.0005/0.0003/0.0002 ETH and 0.5/0.3/0.2 LRT. The organizer withdrew 0.003 ETH fees. The exchange bought, redeemed and withdrew 500 LRT / 0.0000005 ETH. All 20 recorded lifecycle/exchange receipts succeeded.')
