h('Appendix C: Test Code and Selected Outputs',2);p('Complete test code: test/v3-prize.test.js and test/v3-controls.test.js. Malicious receiver: contracts/test/PaymentReceiver.sol. Detailed cases: evidence/test-cases.md and test-cases.json. Full latest run: evidence/test-output.txt (51 passing). Tests execute locally with npm test; no private keys or public transaction spending is required.')
h('Appendix D: Security-Analysis Output',2);p('audit/static-analysis.json preserves all 21 AST review prompts with source locations and SHA256 hashes; audit/security-review.md interprets the controls, residual risks and retest references. The analysis command is npm run analyze. Findings are described in chapter 6 with impact, disposition and retest evidence.')
