h('Appendix F: Additional Diagrams or Metadata',2);p('Roles, state progression and on-chain/off-chain boundaries are explained in chapter 2. The package includes the unmodified supplied template under reference/. docs/guideline-compliance.md maps the final project requirements to exact files. docs/acknowledgements.md records library and AI assistance. package-manifest.json records submission file hashes.')
